It's no use.

253
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:10,080
I can't win.

254
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,860
I can't beat her.

255
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:16,397
You're letting hate get the
better of you, Yu-Gi-Oh.

256
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,310
Stop it.

257
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:24,720
You didn't come this far because you
hated the Integrity Knights, did you?

258
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:27,420
You're here to get Alice back.

259
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:29,961
You're here because you love her.

260
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:31,020
But guess what?

261
00:21:31,620 --> 00:21:35,740
That Integrity Knight, she feels
just as strong about her duty.

262
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:37,337
And I'm no different.

263
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:39,940
I want to protect everyone in this world.

264
00:21:40,740 --> 00:21:41,570
You.

265
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:42,690
Alice.

266
00:21:43,220 --> 00:21:48,800
Even this night, we're so close,
and we can't afford to give up now.

267
00:21:51,580 --> 00:21:53,280
Ain't that right, Yu-Gi-Oh?

268
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:03,580
Enhance Armament!

269
00:22:41,780 --> 00:22:42,897
Thank

270
00:22:42,980 --> 00:22:44,097
you

271
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:51,180
so

272
00:22:56,420 --> 00:22:57,479
much for watching.

273
00:23:11,533 --> 00:23:13,257
And everything turns to dust to dust

274
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:38,580
Next time, the Osmanthus Knight.
